  "description": "On a dynaset over R (64 short rows): FindFirst \"ID = 20\", read Bookmark and the held Fields ID and V. Then db.Execute (dbFailOnError) set V to a 255-character value on IDs 15-25 except 20, and then on ID 20, to make the row grow without a key change. Read the held ID and V, Bookmark; Move 0 and read them and Bookmark; MoveNext and read ID; MovePrevious twice and read ID. The closed file is kept so that a later inspector can say whether the row body moved. Asks whether the cursor's identity and bookmark survive row growth. The fixture copy is opened read-write.",
  "callerSurface": "native-idispatch/x64",
  "invokeLcid": 1033,
